{"schema_version":"1.0","case_id":"rag-citation-003","tags":["correct_citation","cross_page_heading","evidence_supported_answer"],"query":"讲义里为什么缩放点积注意力要除以根号 d_k？","answer_scope":"material_only","rag_response":{"status":"ok","message":"找到 2 条候选证据。"},"retrieved_chunks":[{"chunk_id":"doc-attn:000004","document_id":"doc-attn","text":"当键向量维度 d_k 增大时，未缩放点积的方差随维度增大，softmax 更容易进入梯度很小的饱和区域。因此将点积除以 √d_k，使其数值尺度更稳定。","source":"Transformer原理.pdf","file_type":"pdf","page":12,"h1":"第3章 注意力机制","h2":"缩放点积注意力","similarity":0.91,"rrf_score":0.032787,"routes":["query"]},{"chunk_id":"doc-attn:000009","document_id":"doc-attn","text":"加性注意力用一个前馈网络计算查询与键的兼容性分数。","source":"Transformer原理.pdf","file_type":"pdf","page":18,"h1":"第3章 注意力机制","h2":"加性注意力","similarity":0.59,"rrf_score":0.016129,"routes":["graph"]}],"gold":{"response_mode":"grounded_answer","reference_answer":"因为 d_k 增大时点积方差也会变大，softmax 容易饱和并产生很小的梯度；除以 √d_k 可以稳定数值尺度。【Transformer原理.pdf，第12页，第3章/缩放点积注意力，doc-attn:000004】","claims":[{"claim_id":"c1","text":"缩放用于抑制点积方差随 d_k 增大并避免 softmax 饱和。","support_status":"supported","required_citation_ids":["doc-attn:000004"]}],"required_citation_ids":["doc-attn:000004"],"acceptable_citation_ids":[],"forbidden_citation_ids":["doc-attn:000009"],"required_disclosures":[],"forbidden_assertions":["声称标题缺失或把片段归到加性注意力"],"citation_locations":[{"chunk_id":"doc-attn:000004","source":"Transformer原理.pdf","page":12,"heading":"第3章 注意力机制 / 缩放点积注意力"}]}}
